# .gitignore of the branch results/final-run (its template on main is
# analysis/06_final-run/results_gitignore.txt). RUN_ROOT of the final run is
# the folder results/ of this worktree. Kept: tables, figures, logs, timings,
# the run files (*.rds) and the state of the launcher (results/final-run).

# Keras models: large, and the run files hold what the tables and figures need
*.keras

# a session that is fitting a run: its lock directory and its temporary file
# (R/runs.R), gone when the run is saved; and the state of an unfinished
# nagging block of the NN chain ladder ("NN chain ladder fit.R": the sum of
# the CL factors so far), gone when the block is saved
*.lock/
*.tmp
*.partial

# prepared inputs (data/interim): written again from the raw data by the
# data-preparation scripts. Only the small files the analysis scripts read
# are kept; the cells and network inputs of the machine data (nncl_cells.rds,
# about 100 MB, nncl_inputs.rds) and everything else there stay on the
# computer of the run. The second line keeps the folders open, so that the
# files after it can be kept
results/data/interim/**
!results/data/interim/**/
!results/data/interim/**/triangles.rds
!results/data/interim/**/tri_mack.csv
!results/data/interim/**/nncl_synthetic_cells.rds
!results/data/interim/**/nncl_synthetic*_inputs.rds

# raw data, should RAW_DIR point into results/
results/data/raw/

# NN chain ladder on the machine data (lob6, machine4): the CL factors of a
# main run, feature values x networks, too large for GitHub; its losses,
# reserves and times are in nncl_fit_<run>.rds, which is kept. The SynthETIC
# runs (nncl_synthetic_fit_*, 45 KB with their factors) are kept
results/data/processed/**/nncl_factors_*.rds

# the launcher: processes of the computer of the run
results/final-run/launcher.pid
results/final-run/sessions.csv
results/final-run/quick/sessions.csv

# files over 50 MB: launch.ps1 adds one path a line below before it pushes
